WEBVTT

01:37.620 --> 01:42.990
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.350 --> 01:45.960
[Episode 18]

01:48.000 --> 01:48.750
Qingyuan!

01:50.430 --> 01:52.090
Don't ruin your entire family

01:52.470 --> 01:53.840
just for your mother!

01:55.030 --> 01:56.200
This has...

01:58.789 --> 01:59.990
never been my family.

02:03.150 --> 02:04.070
Qingyuan!

02:12.230 --> 02:13.640
[Harmony Among Kin]

02:13.800 --> 02:14.590
Since Zhenglun

02:14.000 --> 02:19.180
[A Legacy of Virtue for Eternity]

02:14.800 --> 02:16.460
was registered under my name,

02:16.800 --> 02:19.530
he's the legitimate eldest son
of the Xie family.

02:19.680 --> 02:20.630
He deserves

02:21.000 --> 02:22.329
a respectable funeral.

02:22.870 --> 02:25.710
I've invited the Taoist priest
from Qingyang Temple

02:25.710 --> 02:27.840
to conduct rites for 7 days.

02:28.560 --> 02:30.220
Please rest assured, Mother.

02:32.750 --> 02:33.630
Wenzhuo.

02:33.800 --> 02:34.530
Yes, Mother.

02:35.240 --> 02:36.520
See to it that

02:37.470 --> 02:39.400
Yinghua's properly taken care of.

02:39.710 --> 02:41.030
When the funeral takes place,

02:41.030 --> 02:44.030
it's only natural and right
for the biological mother

02:45.120 --> 02:47.240
to see her son off one last time.

02:48.470 --> 02:49.280
Mother,

02:50.710 --> 02:51.910
the physician said

02:52.960 --> 02:55.690
psychosis is most easily triggered
by funerals.

02:56.030 --> 02:58.430
If she makes a scene in the mourning hall,

02:59.430 --> 03:01.160
it'll be a nightmare to handle.

03:05.030 --> 03:08.910
You're truly born stupid.

03:18.160 --> 03:19.850
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

03:20.360 --> 03:21.870
A son of the Xie family

03:22.070 --> 03:23.520
fell on the battlefield,

03:24.520 --> 03:26.520
bringing supreme glory to our name.

03:27.150 --> 03:29.710
If outsiders find out that
you, the Head Madam,

03:29.710 --> 03:32.040
prevented his birth mother, a concubine,

03:33.240 --> 03:34.430
from attending

03:34.430 --> 03:37.590
the funeral of her son
who died with military distinction,

03:37.590 --> 03:40.710
it's not just you who will be disgraced.

03:41.590 --> 03:42.680
If you're worried,

03:43.800 --> 03:45.680
assign four matrons to watch her.

03:46.360 --> 03:49.240
When the time comes,
she can pay her respects

03:50.190 --> 03:51.590
in the side hall.

03:53.710 --> 03:54.310
Yes.

03:54.990 --> 03:59.329
[A Legacy of Virtue for Eternity]

04:03.840 --> 04:06.840
For now, other than Zhenglun's funeral,

04:08.150 --> 04:09.410
leave everything else

04:09.960 --> 04:11.470
in this house alone.

04:19.570 --> 04:22.790
[Harmony Among Kin]

04:26.950 --> 04:28.510
It's been 20 years.

04:33.750 --> 04:36.150
I poured my heart and soul
into this family.

04:37.000 --> 04:39.460
But even with Mei Yinghua
out of the picture,

04:41.190 --> 04:42.850
she still treats me like this.

04:43.220 --> 04:46.580
[A Legacy of Virtue for Eternity]

04:44.510 --> 04:45.240
Madam,

04:45.270 --> 04:46.390
don't worry.

04:47.190 --> 04:49.150
At best, the Old Madam is weaponizing

04:49.150 --> 04:52.280
her seniority and demands for filial piety
against you.

04:53.070 --> 04:55.150
We're not without a backer.

04:56.070 --> 04:57.330
You have your brother.

04:57.920 --> 04:59.050
Why be afraid of her?

05:04.310 --> 05:05.800
I can only rely on him now.

05:07.260 --> 05:10.200
[Cultivate Personal Virtue and Integrity]

05:20.480 --> 05:21.000
My Lady,

05:21.240 --> 05:23.010
I've bought the dried persimmons
you asked for.

05:23.010 --> 05:25.160
A portion's been sent to the mourning hall
for Eldest Young Master.

05:25.160 --> 05:27.090
I brought the other portion to you.

05:28.920 --> 05:29.520
By the way,

05:29.750 --> 05:31.630
here's a letter from Lord Yan.

05:33.790 --> 05:36.690
[Respectfully to
Fourth Lady Qingyuan]

05:39.680 --> 05:40.870
Did Lord Yan

05:41.070 --> 05:42.630
apologize to you?

05:45.650 --> 05:46.830
There was no argument to begin with.

05:46.830 --> 05:47.960
Why'd he apologize?

05:49.630 --> 05:51.630
He's asking me to go see Granny Chen.

05:52.240 --> 05:54.700
I bet he wants her to
put in a good word for him.

05:54.830 --> 05:56.390
He's just counting on the fact

05:56.390 --> 05:58.510
that you can't be angry with him
in front of Granny.

05:56.909 --> 05:58.550
[Sincerely, Yan Rui]

06:00.920 --> 06:01.430
What's wrong?

06:01.430 --> 06:02.690
Did something happen?

06:03.680 --> 06:04.480
Granny is ill.

06:10.800 --> 06:12.310
Lord Yan found out you were sick

06:12.310 --> 06:13.630
before I did.

06:14.070 --> 06:15.930
He's here too, to take care of you.

06:17.430 --> 06:18.000
Here.

06:18.870 --> 06:19.470
Thank you.

06:22.480 --> 06:23.040
Granny,

06:24.310 --> 06:26.040
I've been a bad granddaughter.

06:26.830 --> 06:28.430
Don't say that.

06:29.630 --> 06:32.190
I just caught a mild cold,

06:32.560 --> 06:34.490
and I'm almost all better already.

06:35.270 --> 06:36.870
I'm thrilled that

06:37.600 --> 06:39.000
you and Yan are here.

06:39.680 --> 06:40.830
But my baby,

06:41.390 --> 06:43.950
running out so late at night,

06:43.950 --> 06:45.210
are you sure it's okay?

06:45.310 --> 06:46.070
It's fine.

06:46.720 --> 06:48.680
The entire Xie family is in a mess

06:48.950 --> 06:50.310
and busy with the funeral.

06:50.310 --> 06:51.710
No one has time to mind me.

06:55.800 --> 06:57.150
I heard about that too.

06:58.510 --> 07:00.800
They all say Eldest Young Master Xie

07:01.360 --> 07:03.040
was an upright man.

07:05.430 --> 07:06.360
What a pity.

07:09.920 --> 07:10.720
Dear,

07:11.750 --> 07:13.870
don't be too sad.

07:14.510 --> 07:15.950
Eldest Young Master Xie

07:16.430 --> 07:18.360
led a noble and virtuous life.

07:18.720 --> 07:20.680
He's destined for a blessed next life.

07:20.680 --> 07:24.070
He'll be born into
a wealthy and kind family.

07:30.270 --> 07:32.130
I'll go boil the medicine for you.

07:32.360 --> 07:34.430
Then I'll recover even faster.

07:39.070 --> 07:39.830
Yan.

07:41.720 --> 07:42.320
Come here.

07:43.750 --> 07:44.360
Come here!

07:46.560 --> 07:47.240
Granny.

07:49.070 --> 07:49.830
Yan,

07:50.510 --> 07:51.950
Yunya has always

07:52.270 --> 07:54.120
kept things to herself
since she was little.

07:54.120 --> 07:55.190
It seems

07:55.630 --> 07:58.150
Eldest Young Master Xie's death has been

07:58.510 --> 07:59.770
quite a big blow to her.

08:00.120 --> 08:01.720
Please help me comfort her.

08:06.360 --> 08:07.160
Rest assured.

08:17.400 --> 08:19.390
These are freshly dried persimmons
from Northern Frontier.

08:19.390 --> 08:20.720
They're soft and sweet.

08:21.120 --> 08:22.250
I picked three kinds

08:22.480 --> 08:24.410
and chose the sweetest one for you.

08:24.510 --> 08:25.170
Take a look.

08:26.160 --> 08:27.190
If you like them,

08:27.630 --> 08:29.430
I'll dry a whole rack when I get back

08:29.430 --> 08:30.960
just for us siblings to eat.

08:59.360 --> 09:00.240
Are you okay?

09:06.000 --> 09:06.630
I'm fine.

09:10.120 --> 09:12.650
Even Granny Chen could tell
you're troubled.

09:13.120 --> 09:14.650
She asked me to comfort you.

09:19.910 --> 09:21.170
When my eldest brother

09:21.200 --> 09:22.360
came back this time,

09:23.510 --> 09:26.640
he brought me some
Northern Frontier dried persimmons.

09:26.870 --> 09:28.130
I liked them very much.

09:29.120 --> 09:31.120
He said he'd bring me more next time.

09:32.000 --> 09:33.660
But there won't be a next time.

09:35.790 --> 09:37.390
Sometimes I wonder:

09:39.670 --> 09:40.630
if I hadn't

09:41.840 --> 09:43.510
come to the Xie Residence,

09:45.200 --> 09:46.720
would he still be alive?

09:53.480 --> 09:54.360
Yan Rui,

09:56.510 --> 09:57.790
why are human lives

09:58.720 --> 10:00.240
so short?

10:01.960 --> 10:03.360
So short that there's...

10:05.910 --> 10:07.840
not even time for a proper goodbye.

10:17.360 --> 10:18.440
Xie Qingyuan,

10:18.910 --> 10:20.040
it's not your fault.

10:20.960 --> 10:22.290
That was a battlefield,

10:22.360 --> 10:25.150
where thousands of lives are sacrificed
for one general's victory.

10:25.150 --> 10:26.360
As a general,

10:27.480 --> 10:29.810
Zhenglun must've been prepared for this.

10:33.550 --> 10:35.390
Many soldiers perish in battle.

10:36.600 --> 10:38.060
Zhenglun isn't the first,

10:38.550 --> 10:39.960
and he won't be the last.

10:46.790 --> 10:49.000
I've seen arrows fall like rainstorms

10:51.150 --> 10:53.550
and wounded comrades crawling in the mud.

10:54.870 --> 10:56.800
The blood soaked in melted snow...

10:59.150 --> 11:00.480
is as hot as this stove.

11:15.150 --> 11:17.410
I've actually been wanting to ask you...

11:21.630 --> 11:22.510
Are you...

11:26.120 --> 11:27.250
-Actually, I…
-Yan.

11:28.440 --> 11:29.300
It's time to go.

11:29.750 --> 11:30.510
It's 7:45 PM.

11:36.510 --> 11:37.440
You're leaving?

11:42.750 --> 11:44.680
Hengtang is full of watchful eyes.

11:44.720 --> 11:45.600
If we don't leave now,

11:45.600 --> 11:47.530
who knows what trouble might come.

11:56.550 --> 11:57.880
Wait for me to come back.

12:01.630 --> 12:02.560
When I come back,

12:02.910 --> 12:04.510
whatever you want to know...

12:07.320 --> 12:08.200
I will tell you.

12:38.390 --> 12:39.630
I told you

12:39.910 --> 12:41.840
she'd only hold you back.

12:40.000 --> 12:41.970
[Chen]

12:42.840 --> 12:43.750
So,

12:43.960 --> 12:45.960
you came to find me an hour early?

12:47.750 --> 12:49.410
I'm cutting the Gordian knot.

12:49.960 --> 12:51.560
You were reluctant to leave,

12:51.670 --> 12:53.080
so I had to give you a push.

13:00.600 --> 13:02.200
Let Granny have a look at you.

13:06.670 --> 13:07.870
You've lost weight.

13:09.200 --> 13:10.840
Blame the chefs at Xie Residence.

13:10.840 --> 13:12.900
Their cooking isn't as good as yours.

13:13.790 --> 13:16.840
When did you learn to be a smooth talker?

13:17.550 --> 13:18.270
Sit here.

13:18.870 --> 13:20.720
I'll make you 2 sugar pancakes,

13:20.910 --> 13:22.720
your favorite when you were a kid.

13:22.720 --> 13:23.320
Granny,

13:23.670 --> 13:25.930
you just took your medicine. Go to sleep.

13:26.320 --> 13:26.960
I'm okay.

13:26.960 --> 13:27.960
Feel my forehead.

13:27.960 --> 13:30.550
After taking your medicine,
my fever is gone.

13:32.320 --> 13:33.450
You don't want food,

13:33.630 --> 13:35.670
but I do! How else am I

13:35.670 --> 13:36.630
to fall asleep?

13:38.750 --> 13:39.960
Eat some with me.

13:41.960 --> 13:42.510
Okay.

13:42.630 --> 13:43.360
I'll make it.

13:44.240 --> 13:46.440
Will it taste the same if you make it?

13:46.960 --> 13:47.960
Sit here and wait.

13:50.670 --> 13:53.000
Yan is such a good kid.

14:16.910 --> 14:17.840
When I come back,

14:18.200 --> 14:19.660
whatever you want to know,

14:20.750 --> 14:21.610
I will tell you.

14:27.550 --> 14:28.510
Granny?

14:30.480 --> 14:31.200
Granny.

14:35.320 --> 14:36.550
Lady Xie.

14:42.840 --> 14:44.500
Lord Wei, what brings you here

14:45.000 --> 14:46.000
at this late hour?

14:46.550 --> 14:49.440
I came to ask you
for a cup of tea, of course.

14:51.720 --> 14:53.360
Sorry to trouble you.

14:54.600 --> 14:56.440
I only have low-grade tea,

14:57.030 --> 14:59.030
which might not suit your taste.

15:00.320 --> 15:01.030
Therefore,

15:01.910 --> 15:03.790
I must trouble you

15:03.790 --> 15:05.200
to come with me.

15:08.230 --> 15:09.850
Yunya, run!

15:10.600 --> 15:11.320
Granny!

15:14.150 --> 15:14.870
Let her go!

15:15.960 --> 15:16.890
I'll go with you.

15:47.670 --> 15:48.440
My Lord!

15:49.960 --> 15:51.020
Stop the carriage.

15:51.790 --> 15:52.550
My Lord!

15:53.480 --> 15:54.910
Fourth Lady's been abducted.

15:54.910 --> 15:56.320
I was also told to relay a message:

15:56.320 --> 15:57.360
go to the old Shen residence

15:57.360 --> 15:58.320
alone,

15:58.550 --> 15:59.550
or she dies!

16:03.840 --> 16:04.790
If you go,

16:05.030 --> 16:06.510
we're no longer brothers.

16:22.910 --> 16:23.790
Lord Wei,

16:24.440 --> 16:26.410
if you're trying to use me as bait

16:26.510 --> 16:28.000
to lure Lord Yan out,

16:28.440 --> 16:30.440
I'm afraid you'll be disappointed.

16:31.030 --> 16:32.830
I'm just a plaything for Lord Yan

16:33.030 --> 16:34.320
in Hengtang

16:34.670 --> 16:35.510
to kill time

16:35.510 --> 16:37.550
when he is bored.

16:38.200 --> 16:39.530
If you don't believe me,

16:40.390 --> 16:42.390
you can lock me up for a night and see.

16:43.120 --> 16:44.670
Ouch, My Lady,

16:44.870 --> 16:47.070
your words are like daggers to my heart.

16:50.790 --> 16:52.550
Lord Yan, how gutsy of you

16:53.030 --> 16:54.870
to come alone.

16:55.200 --> 16:56.510
Impressive.

16:57.840 --> 16:58.870
Lord Wei,

16:59.320 --> 17:01.520
you went to such lengths to lure me here,

17:01.600 --> 17:03.080
but have you ever considered

17:03.080 --> 17:04.160
that if you kill me,

17:04.510 --> 17:05.770
you won't live either?

17:08.349 --> 17:09.550
Then let's find out.

17:21.720 --> 17:23.349
Even if I can't defeat you,

17:25.000 --> 17:27.460
someone will accompany me
to the afterlife.

17:36.790 --> 17:37.830
Lord Yan,

17:38.270 --> 17:39.330
doesn't this place

17:40.640 --> 17:42.160
feel familiar to you?

17:58.480 --> 17:59.160
My Lord,

17:59.440 --> 18:01.110
guilty of bribery and corruption,

18:01.110 --> 18:02.680
Shen Zhibai's estate has been seized,

18:02.680 --> 18:04.160
and 73 people in his residence

18:04.160 --> 18:05.790
have been executed on the spot.

18:05.790 --> 18:06.480
But...

18:06.590 --> 18:07.270
What is it?

18:08.100 --> 18:09.310
His eldest son, Shen Run,

18:09.310 --> 18:10.370
wasn't among them.

18:10.550 --> 18:12.880
Someone saw him in a house
in the south of the city.

18:12.880 --> 18:14.410
Leave no survivors.

18:15.000 --> 18:15.880
Go find him now!

18:16.200 --> 18:16.720
Yes!

18:22.070 --> 18:23.640
That night, 9 years ago,

18:24.680 --> 18:27.310
the whole family here
was killed overnight,

18:28.550 --> 18:30.550
and only two kids managed to escape.

18:37.350 --> 18:40.350
Before, I couldn't figure out

18:40.920 --> 18:42.160
why you,

18:42.680 --> 18:46.270
Lord Yan, targeted me at every turn.

18:48.750 --> 18:50.480
But the night of the grain distribution,

18:50.480 --> 18:51.740
I finally understood.

18:52.750 --> 18:54.240
The enemy is right in front of you,

18:54.240 --> 18:55.880
yet you still think about that woman.

18:55.880 --> 18:57.810
Do you really think you're Yan Rui?

19:01.000 --> 19:05.480
You're one of the two bastards
who escaped from the Shen residence—

19:06.030 --> 19:07.270
Shen Run.

19:27.790 --> 19:28.550
Kill him.

20:14.750 --> 20:15.350
Freeze!

20:39.440 --> 20:40.440
Wei Changyan,

20:41.310 --> 20:42.640
I can give you a way out.

20:43.350 --> 20:44.410
Let her go, and I'll

20:45.030 --> 20:47.160
personally escort you out of the city.

20:49.310 --> 20:51.790
Such great kindness, Lord Yan.

20:52.270 --> 20:54.830
You're making me emotional.

20:55.400 --> 20:56.440
However,

20:57.070 --> 20:59.000
you must also show some sincerity.

21:00.000 --> 21:00.930
Forget about me.

21:03.550 --> 21:04.510
If I die,

21:04.510 --> 21:05.550
kill him for me.

21:07.720 --> 21:09.240
What a woman of steel.

21:10.680 --> 21:11.550
Lord Yan,

21:12.110 --> 21:13.570
if you don't want her dead,

21:14.270 --> 21:15.440
put down the sword.

21:33.270 --> 21:33.850
Kill him!

21:45.540 --> 21:49.870
♪ I counted every moment ♪

21:49.940 --> 21:54.030
♪ Memories take root;
the annual rings grow ♪

21:54.050 --> 21:58.570
♪ Who bore the parting wind ♪

21:58.600 --> 22:03.330
♪ And wove it gently into the warmth
of the past? ♪

22:03.310 --> 22:04.720
Have you ever loved a woman?

22:03.360 --> 22:07.530
♪ I honor every scar upon your hand ♪

22:07.110 --> 22:08.400
I just want to know

22:07.550 --> 22:11.940
♪ Through endless nights,
a lone soul wanders this mortal world ♪

22:09.440 --> 22:10.900
under what circumstances

22:11.110 --> 22:12.750
a man would

22:11.960 --> 22:18.620
♪ Turning back, we embrace—
one fleeting moment of love and hate ♪

22:14.000 --> 22:15.790
give up the woman he loves.

22:18.690 --> 22:21.620
♪ As flowers fall beneath the dusk ♪

22:20.270 --> 22:21.440
Don't be anxious.

22:21.830 --> 22:25.030
I'll send you two star-crossed lovers
to the afterlife

22:25.550 --> 22:27.000
together right now.

22:30.200 --> 22:31.310
To protect her.

22:57.880 --> 22:58.350
Yan...

23:45.200 --> 23:46.270
All we can do is

23:47.270 --> 23:49.200
remember the faces of our enemies.

23:49.590 --> 23:50.510
When we grow up,

23:51.310 --> 23:52.770
no matter where they hide,

23:53.240 --> 23:55.240
no matter how many of them there are,

23:55.830 --> 23:58.160
we must bring the truth to light

23:58.590 --> 24:01.110
and bring the sinners to justice.

24:29.000 --> 24:31.180
[Qinyue Corridor]

24:32.960 --> 24:33.830
Go inside.

24:35.070 --> 24:36.200
Clean yourself up.

24:36.480 --> 24:37.480
Don't get caught.

24:37.790 --> 24:39.200
But I still have a lot of things to do—

24:39.200 --> 24:39.830
I know.

24:40.440 --> 24:41.590
Meet me at midnight,

24:42.080 --> 24:46.100
[Danyue Pavilion]

24:42.550 --> 24:44.680
at the place we said goodbye back then.

24:44.960 --> 24:46.420
I'll tell you everything.

24:55.500 --> 24:56.500
I'll wait for you.

24:58.790 --> 24:59.440
Go along.

25:08.690 --> 25:10.050
[Danyue Pavilion]

25:22.110 --> 25:24.910
[Danyue Pavilion]

25:35.880 --> 25:36.830
My Lady!

25:37.310 --> 25:38.640
You're finally back!

25:39.270 --> 25:40.870
Why are you covered in blood?

25:41.440 --> 25:42.310
Are you hurt?

25:43.400 --> 25:44.200
I'm fine.

25:44.830 --> 25:45.590
I'm great.

25:46.590 --> 25:47.830
How could you be fine?

25:47.830 --> 25:49.630
I'll get you some clean clothes.

25:56.870 --> 25:59.720
[Danyue Pavilion]

26:04.880 --> 26:05.940
Sesame flatbread!

26:06.880 --> 26:08.550
Fresh out of the oven!

26:10.310 --> 26:17.000
♪ Spring comes to the long gate,
green grass sprouts ♪

26:17.010 --> 26:24.000
♪ Red plums bear dewdrops,
bright and serene ♪

26:24.010 --> 26:27.150
♪ Year by year, time drifts along ♪

26:24.270 --> 26:25.590
Never have I imagined

26:25.960 --> 26:27.790
that the hours from dawn to dusk

26:27.160 --> 26:30.900
♪ Warmth and chill
of mortal meet and part ♪

26:28.110 --> 26:29.640
could be so painfully long.

26:30.950 --> 26:38.450
♪ No need to heed the wind's soft whisper
and ask about your return ♪

26:38.520 --> 26:45.640
♪ Wild geese soar through deep clouds,
waiting for the moon to rest ♪

26:38.920 --> 26:42.070
Shen Run, I miss you so much.

26:43.440 --> 26:44.000
I have

26:44.000 --> 26:46.510
so much to say to you after all this time.

26:45.770 --> 26:52.800
♪ Old memories lie heavy,
haunting every dream ♪

26:47.440 --> 26:48.960
I've also dreamed up

26:49.480 --> 26:51.790
countless ways we would reunite

26:52.750 --> 26:53.750
or

26:52.850 --> 26:56.020
♪ Rises and falls take turns ♪

26:54.000 --> 26:56.640
tragically miss each other for a lifetime.

26:56.040 --> 26:59.210
♪ Phases of the moon,
unplanned to wax and wane ♪

26:57.440 --> 26:59.110
I just never imagined

26:59.270 --> 27:07.680
♪ Count fallen blooms,
yet never count all pains of parting ♪

27:00.070 --> 27:01.590
that fate had already

27:02.350 --> 27:03.830
woven us together,

27:04.720 --> 27:06.550
long before

27:07.000 --> 27:08.270
we even knew it.

27:07.500 --> 27:14.150
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

27:14.200 --> 27:21.100
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

27:15.640 --> 27:16.170
Baoxian.

27:16.790 --> 27:17.480
My Lady!

27:18.720 --> 27:19.960
What time is it?

27:21.110 --> 27:22.640
It'll be dark in half an hour.

27:21.110 --> 27:25.350
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

27:25.380 --> 27:28.800
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

27:27.700 --> 27:28.790
[Danyue Pavilion]

27:28.800 --> 27:33.780
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

27:30.270 --> 27:31.200
My Lady!

27:31.480 --> 27:32.610
Where are you going?

27:33.030 --> 27:33.960
My Lady!

27:33.790 --> 27:35.870
[Danyue Pavilion]

27:34.720 --> 27:36.350
If I'd known it was you earlier,

27:35.990 --> 27:43.140
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

27:37.070 --> 27:38.110
would things be

27:38.110 --> 27:39.570
different between us now?

27:40.640 --> 27:42.110
Perhaps I should accept

27:42.440 --> 27:44.400
that meeting like this

27:43.200 --> 27:50.100
♪ Greet the soft, mild evening breeze
and homebound sail to land ♪

27:45.270 --> 27:48.440
is the best arrangement heaven has for us.

27:50.160 --> 27:54.000
♪ Slim moonbeams
weave tangled dreams all night ♪

27:54.050 --> 27:57.410
♪ The homeward boat glides slowly
through dark twilight ♪

27:57.450 --> 28:03.870
♪ I walk and gaze; one cup of spring
fades to lingering cheer ♪

28:00.960 --> 28:01.920
Shen Run!

28:05.920 --> 28:06.880
Shen Run!

28:26.960 --> 28:29.000
Yunya, I'm sorry.

28:29.310 --> 28:30.790
I broke my promise again.

28:31.590 --> 28:33.990
Many times, I wanted to
let you know who I am.

28:34.550 --> 28:35.880
But when I thought about

28:36.070 --> 28:38.310
how we both have our own revenge to seek

28:39.070 --> 28:40.790
and our uncertain endings,

28:42.110 --> 28:44.110
I asked myself what the best outcome

28:44.400 --> 28:46.130
for our relationship would be.

28:46.550 --> 28:47.920
It'd be to maintain our own paths

28:47.920 --> 28:50.550
without disturbing each other's hearts.

28:52.240 --> 28:53.960
But how could my heart

28:53.860 --> 29:01.000
♪ Wild geese soar through deep clouds,
waiting for the moon to rest ♪

28:54.270 --> 28:56.030
possibly resist you?

29:00.750 --> 29:01.880
You know what, Yunya?

29:01.030 --> 29:07.790
♪ Old memories lie heavy,
haunting every dream ♪

29:03.000 --> 29:04.240
I thought there was nothing left

29:04.240 --> 29:05.400
for me in this world

29:05.790 --> 29:06.920
but revenge.

29:07.800 --> 29:11.350
♪ Rises and falls take turns ♪

29:08.000 --> 29:09.350
Until I met you.

29:11.400 --> 29:15.000
♪ Phases of the moon,
unplanned to wax and wane ♪

29:11.440 --> 29:12.550
The little girl who

29:13.070 --> 29:14.800
gave me hope on that snowy night

29:15.010 --> 29:22.400
♪ Count fallen blooms,
yet never count all pains of parting ♪

29:16.790 --> 29:17.960
has now grown up.

29:19.240 --> 29:20.240
She is prettier

29:20.960 --> 29:22.160
and braver.

29:22.420 --> 29:29.030
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

29:25.270 --> 29:26.160
Little Monkey,

29:27.110 --> 29:28.840
I've never forgotten our oath.

29:29.080 --> 29:36.500
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

29:29.750 --> 29:31.000
Please wait for me.

29:31.790 --> 29:33.070
I shall return

29:34.590 --> 29:35.790
to fulfill our tryst

29:36.270 --> 29:37.350
at the ruined temple.

29:36.520 --> 29:40.230
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

29:40.260 --> 29:43.790
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

29:43.920 --> 29:50.820
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

29:50.870 --> 29:58.520
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

29:58.540 --> 30:05.270
♪ Greet the soft, mild evening breeze
and homebound sail to land ♪

30:05.280 --> 30:09.320
♪ Slim moonbeams
weave tangled dreams all night ♪

30:09.330 --> 30:12.850
♪ The homeward boat glides slowly
through dark twilight ♪

30:12.880 --> 30:20.050
♪ I walk and gaze; one cup of spring
fades to lingering cheer ♪

30:20.070 --> 30:28.210
♪ I chant and sigh; one cup of spring,
drunk through turns of year ♪

30:48.880 --> 30:50.640
I'm so sorry about Zhenglun.

30:51.590 --> 30:54.440
You and Old Madam
must be heartbroken right now.

30:55.440 --> 30:57.500
But today is your birthday after all.

30:57.960 --> 30:59.640
Let's have a chat

30:59.880 --> 31:01.030
to ease your mind.

31:02.070 --> 31:03.790
Why don't I see Qingrong?

31:05.400 --> 31:06.440
That child's been

31:06.960 --> 31:08.550
acting strangely these past few days.

31:08.550 --> 31:10.080
She always looks listless,

31:10.440 --> 31:12.640
as if something is weighing on her mind.

31:13.480 --> 31:14.680
The girl is growing up

31:14.750 --> 31:16.030
and has her own ideas.

31:16.070 --> 31:17.600
She'll be fine in a few days.

31:17.790 --> 31:18.960
Here, have some tea.

31:21.440 --> 31:22.770
What are you doing here?

31:22.920 --> 31:24.680
Aren't you keen on that phony?

31:25.070 --> 31:25.720
What?

31:26.030 --> 31:27.720
Your lover packed up and left,

31:27.920 --> 31:30.050
so you want to seduce my Chunzhi again?

31:33.400 --> 31:34.860
I'm asking you a question.

31:36.200 --> 31:37.030
Qingru.

31:39.400 --> 31:40.680
Mother, your hairpin

31:41.680 --> 31:42.960
looks simple

31:43.240 --> 31:43.970
and elegant,

31:45.240 --> 31:46.900
but it doesn't look ordinary.

31:47.240 --> 31:48.720
You're too young to know.

31:49.310 --> 31:50.310
This hairpin was

31:50.400 --> 31:52.600
made by a master craftsman in Jiangnan.

31:52.830 --> 31:54.030
It's truly

31:54.030 --> 31:55.440
one of a kind.

31:56.400 --> 31:57.920
It's just an old thing.

31:58.600 --> 32:01.590
It's inappropriate to wear flashy things
during the mourning period,

32:01.590 --> 32:03.720
so I made it a point to pick a simple one.

32:04.480 --> 32:05.940
I shot it right in the head,

32:06.240 --> 32:07.830
killing it instantly

32:08.830 --> 32:10.440
with just one arrow.

32:10.640 --> 32:11.440
I'll show you.

32:11.550 --> 32:13.010
Look at my archery skills.

32:13.790 --> 32:14.750
Aren't I cool?

32:18.440 --> 32:19.440
Do you know her?

32:31.750 --> 32:32.680
Long time no see.

32:37.070 --> 32:38.310
Long time no see.

32:39.770 --> 32:40.750
Chunzhi.

32:40.920 --> 32:42.030
Qingru's been

32:42.310 --> 32:44.440
studying floral art since she was little.

32:44.440 --> 32:45.770
Her use of peonies today

32:45.830 --> 32:47.030
is just wonderful.

32:47.510 --> 32:48.510
What do you think?

32:49.550 --> 32:50.000
Good.

32:50.240 --> 32:50.840
Very good.

32:56.440 --> 32:57.240
Chunzhi,

32:57.790 --> 32:59.440
you two hang out here.

32:59.880 --> 33:01.410
I'll go prepare some fruit.

33:01.720 --> 33:02.780
Thank you, Mother.

33:02.880 --> 33:03.480
Good girl.

33:05.070 --> 33:06.200
Take care, Madam Hu.

33:07.240 --> 33:09.500
Marriages in a small place like Hengtang

33:09.640 --> 33:11.170
have always been like this.

33:11.480 --> 33:13.400
They look for families of equal status

33:13.400 --> 33:15.720
and choose those with similar backgrounds.

33:15.720 --> 33:16.510
In the end,

33:17.070 --> 33:19.270
it's just picking from
the leftovers of these

33:19.270 --> 33:20.530
four or five families.

33:20.680 --> 33:22.940
Even if both families detest each other,

33:23.200 --> 33:24.240
well aware that

33:24.590 --> 33:26.740
the other is far from virtuous,

33:27.000 --> 33:29.590
they still go through
with the marriage alliance.

33:29.590 --> 33:33.270
All they want is for their descendants

33:33.720 --> 33:35.640
to be deeply rooted

33:36.110 --> 33:37.350
in Hengtang,

33:37.830 --> 33:39.070
so as to

33:39.440 --> 33:43.030
safeguard their place
at this table of future wealth.

33:44.070 --> 33:45.000
These words of yours

33:45.000 --> 33:46.350
are truly

33:46.680 --> 33:47.830
enlightening.

33:48.590 --> 33:49.750
For this marriage between

33:49.750 --> 33:51.610
the Xie family and the marquis's,

33:51.750 --> 33:53.610
no matter who is chosen in the end,

33:53.640 --> 33:54.960
it's a great blessing

33:55.400 --> 33:56.750
for the Xie family.

33:59.790 --> 34:01.640
Everyone says you're clever.

34:02.270 --> 34:03.480
Meeting you today,

34:03.830 --> 34:05.200
I see it is indeed true.

34:06.310 --> 34:08.570
It seems you've already anticipated it.

34:09.920 --> 34:10.880
I understand.

34:11.510 --> 34:13.880
Young Master Li thinks
he is engaged to me,

34:14.360 --> 34:17.230
when you and my mother
have actually chosen

34:17.230 --> 34:18.230
my second sister.

34:24.440 --> 34:25.670
Next,

34:26.590 --> 34:28.670
which of these two do you want to use?

34:28.960 --> 34:29.820
Either is fine.

34:30.030 --> 34:31.360
Pick one. Look.

34:31.510 --> 34:32.360
Which color?

34:32.360 --> 34:33.159
This one then.

34:35.920 --> 34:37.550
Since you've seen through it,

34:37.550 --> 34:38.840
I'll be frank with you.

34:40.840 --> 34:42.280
Chunzhi always told me

34:42.590 --> 34:44.389
you're the only one he'll marry.

34:44.960 --> 34:46.960
I have reasoned with him many times,

34:47.440 --> 34:49.230
but he takes after his father.

34:49.840 --> 34:51.590
Once he sets his mind on something,

34:51.590 --> 34:53.520
no one can persuade him otherwise.

34:54.110 --> 34:56.760
I do have doubts about your background,

34:57.030 --> 34:58.890
but what I'm more concerned about

34:59.110 --> 35:01.590
is that marrying someone
who doesn't love you

35:01.590 --> 35:04.320
dooms you to a lifetime
of misery and heartbreak.

35:04.850 --> 35:06.650
I can't let that happen to my boy.

35:09.360 --> 35:10.440
I understand.

35:11.230 --> 35:12.480
That's why

35:12.920 --> 35:14.420
I'm willing to

35:14.920 --> 35:17.840
play along with the plan
you and Mother set up today.

35:22.960 --> 35:23.920
What a pity.

35:23.920 --> 35:25.370
Here you are.

35:28.480 --> 35:29.230
Mother.

35:30.110 --> 35:31.970
Try these freshly picked fruits.

35:32.710 --> 35:33.440
This is nice.

35:36.190 --> 35:37.190
Qingru!

35:39.000 --> 35:39.600
Come here.

35:41.230 --> 35:42.000
Chunzhi,

35:42.000 --> 35:43.510
wait for me here.

35:44.070 --> 35:46.730
This has always been
Chunzhi's favorite fruit.

35:47.230 --> 35:48.440
Bring them to him

35:49.070 --> 35:50.270
and keep him company.

35:50.280 --> 35:50.880
Yes.

36:05.840 --> 36:06.630
Qingyuan.

36:10.030 --> 36:10.510
Come,

36:10.800 --> 36:11.280
let me.

36:13.710 --> 36:14.510
Mother,

36:14.630 --> 36:15.360
Madam Li.

36:16.920 --> 36:17.590
Mother,

36:18.000 --> 36:19.190
all of Hengtang is talking about

36:19.190 --> 36:21.120
Chunzhi and Qingyuan's marriage.

36:21.280 --> 36:24.140
Why are you still letting them
spend time together?

36:33.320 --> 36:34.110
Madam Li,

36:36.480 --> 36:37.440
it's time

36:38.360 --> 36:39.950
we have a good talk about

36:40.800 --> 36:42.600
Chunzhi and Qingru's marriage.

36:46.030 --> 36:46.920
Qingyuan,

36:47.000 --> 36:48.670
This "Time-Tested Formulas
for Lifelong Wellness"

36:48.670 --> 36:50.100
is from my family's collection.

36:50.100 --> 36:51.250
This is likely the world's only copy

36:51.250 --> 36:52.840
outside the imperial archives.

36:52.840 --> 36:54.630
I thought you might find it useful.

36:53.130 --> 36:54.670
[Time-Tested Formulas
for Lifelong Wellness]

36:57.360 --> 36:58.560
This is too precious.

36:58.880 --> 37:00.550
I've done nothing to earn it.

37:01.070 --> 37:01.960
Just take it.

37:01.960 --> 37:03.800
My family knows nothing about medicine.

37:03.800 --> 37:05.760
It'll just gather dust in our study.

37:05.760 --> 37:07.020
You, on the other hand,

37:07.070 --> 37:09.800
might be able to use it
to save lives in the future.

37:11.450 --> 37:12.820
[Time-Tested Formulas
for Lifelong Wellness]

37:19.550 --> 37:20.630
You know how I feel,

37:21.280 --> 37:22.680
and I know what you think.

37:23.510 --> 37:25.370
Aren't we a kind of perfect match?

37:27.280 --> 37:28.320
People always say

37:29.030 --> 37:30.560
humans are cold and fickle.

37:30.900 --> 37:32.030
One minute you like something,

37:32.030 --> 37:33.290
and the next you don't.

37:33.840 --> 37:34.570
But I believe

37:34.960 --> 37:36.320
the opposite is also true:

37:36.320 --> 37:37.840
one can grow to love someone

37:37.840 --> 37:38.840
they used to have

37:39.150 --> 37:40.080
no feelings for.

37:40.590 --> 37:41.280
Qingyuan,

37:41.500 --> 37:43.150
I'm serious about marrying you.

37:43.150 --> 37:44.680
What if one day you actually

37:45.070 --> 37:46.270
start falling for me?

37:46.280 --> 37:46.880
What if?

37:48.880 --> 37:49.880
If I were fickle,

37:50.400 --> 37:51.630
how could I be worthy

37:51.630 --> 37:52.920
of your affection?

37:54.110 --> 37:54.760
Qingyuan.

37:56.710 --> 37:58.710
Don't jump to conclusions just yet.

37:58.880 --> 37:59.630
I believe

38:00.800 --> 38:01.600
that someday,

38:02.960 --> 38:04.400
you'll give me an answer.

38:10.360 --> 38:11.150
Chunzhi.

38:13.480 --> 38:14.110
Come here.

38:14.190 --> 38:14.800
Okay!

38:19.670 --> 38:20.360
Qingyuan,

38:20.920 --> 38:21.980
my mother needs me.

38:22.110 --> 38:23.170
I'll be right back.

38:30.030 --> 38:30.920
My Lady,

38:31.320 --> 38:33.000
Marchioness of Danyang has made it clear

38:33.000 --> 38:35.150
that she disagrees with this marriage.

38:35.150 --> 38:36.230
Why didn't you...

38:39.920 --> 38:40.780
Young Master Li

38:41.190 --> 38:42.450
is too pure-hearted to

38:42.630 --> 38:44.090
anticipate such schemes.

38:44.760 --> 38:46.630
Since I'm not planning to marry him,

38:46.630 --> 38:48.440
there's no need to go into all that.

38:48.440 --> 38:49.570
And I don't want to be

38:49.670 --> 38:52.670
the villain who drives a wedge
between mother and son.

38:52.840 --> 38:54.840
But Madam Hu is quite strange too.

38:55.150 --> 38:56.590
She actually let you

38:56.590 --> 38:58.800
and her carefully chosen son-in-law

38:58.920 --> 39:00.380
admire flowers together.

39:01.960 --> 39:02.760
Qingrong.

39:03.190 --> 39:05.230
You've been so preoccupied lately.

39:05.760 --> 39:07.070
What is going on?

39:07.550 --> 39:08.760
Talk to me.

39:09.030 --> 39:10.760
Please put my mind at ease.

39:16.360 --> 39:17.110
Mother,

39:18.440 --> 39:19.500
was my birth mother

39:20.670 --> 39:22.840
really killed by Mei Yinghua?

39:24.880 --> 39:27.210
I resented Jin Chunqing
for so many years.

39:27.630 --> 39:29.070
Did I get it all wrong?

39:32.880 --> 39:33.630
Mother,

39:34.190 --> 39:35.190
is there more

39:35.710 --> 39:37.320
to my mother's death?

39:40.670 --> 39:42.480
Oh, Mei Yinghua,

39:42.920 --> 39:44.780
after all the evil you've done...

39:45.480 --> 39:46.880
Everyone knows

39:46.880 --> 39:49.280
she's just trying to
wiggle out of trouble.

39:51.000 --> 39:52.800
How could you believe her words?

39:53.230 --> 39:53.920
I...

39:57.920 --> 39:59.180
Since you were little,

39:59.880 --> 40:02.230
you've always been too straightforward

40:02.760 --> 40:04.070
and easily misled.

40:06.150 --> 40:07.950
I've protected you for 19 years,

40:08.840 --> 40:09.880
but I can't

40:10.280 --> 40:11.920
protect you forever.

40:15.920 --> 40:17.440
If you believe everything

40:18.230 --> 40:19.280
others say

40:20.190 --> 40:21.070
or do,

40:22.000 --> 40:22.880
my heart will

40:23.880 --> 40:25.030
break with worry.

40:25.590 --> 40:26.360
Mother,

40:26.360 --> 40:27.110
I...

40:28.960 --> 40:29.670
Qingrong,

40:30.760 --> 40:31.820
you've always been

40:32.400 --> 40:34.280
smarter than Qingru and Qinghe.

40:35.760 --> 40:37.590
No matter what others say,

40:38.550 --> 40:40.280
you should know in your heart

40:42.190 --> 40:42.760
who

40:43.960 --> 40:45.360
truly cares about you.

40:50.400 --> 40:51.110
If

40:51.760 --> 40:53.110
you feel restless,

40:53.800 --> 40:55.130
go to the ancestral hall

40:55.510 --> 40:58.590
and burn some Rebirth Sutras
for your mother.

40:59.230 --> 41:01.890
It's a way to pray
for her peace in the afterlife.

41:04.710 --> 41:06.070
Rest early then,

41:06.070 --> 41:06.840
Mother.
